# Environment Template

Copy this to `.env.local` in the mobile/ directory and fill in your values.

```env
# ============================================
# Firebase Configuration
# ============================================
# Get these from your Firebase Console
# Project Settings > Your apps > Web app config

EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyD_xxx...
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project.firebaseapp.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your-project.appspot.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=123456789
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:123456789:web:abc123def456

# ============================================
# Backend API
# ============================================
# URL of your FastAPI backend
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://helper-495902.cloudfunctions.net

# ============================================
# Expo Configuration
# ============================================
# Get from Expo dashboard after eas build:configure
EXPO_PUBLIC_PROJECT_ID=bridge-app

# ============================================
# Feature Flags (Optional)
# ============================================
EXPO_PUBLIC_ENABLE_PUSH_NOTIFICATIONS=true
EXPO_PUBLIC_ENABLE_OFFLINE_MODE=true
EXPO_PUBLIC_ENABLE_ANALYTICS=true

# ============================================
# Gemini AI Configuration (Optional)
# ============================================
# For image analysis - handled by backend
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_ENABLED=true
